                  tackle these challenges, we introduce a novel and
                  generalizable framework: NeuroBOLT, i.e., Neuro-to-BOLD
                  Transformer, which leverages multi-dimensional representation
                  learning from temporal, spatial, and spectral domains to
                  translate raw EEG data to the corresponding fMRI activity
                  signals across the brain. Our experiments demonstrate that
