  doi          = {10.1155/2022/6320973},
  abstract     = {Objective: This study aims to observe the changes in pupil
                  diameter (PD) after anesthesia with different doses of
                  sufentanil with the ultrasound method and observe whether
                  pupil contraction is correlated with hemodynamic changes and
                  bispectral index (BIS) values. Methods: A total of 124
                  patients between the ages of 18-65 with ASA I-II undergoing
                  general anesthesia for surgery were enrolled in the study.
                  According to the sufentanil dose initially injected, they were
