  doi          = {10.1016/j.neuron.2020.07.001},
  abstract     = {Any cognitive function is mediated by a network of many
                  cortical sites whose activity is orchestrated through complex
                  temporal dynamics. To understand cognition, we need to
                  identify brain responses simultaneously in space and time.
                  Here we present a technique that does this by linking
