                  input image and an output image using a training set of
                  aligned image pairs. However, for many tasks, paired training
                  data will not be available. We present an approach for
                  learning to translate an image from a source domain $X$ to a
                  target domain $Y$ in the absence of paired examples. Our goal
                  is to learn a mapping $G: X \rightarrow Y$ such that the
