                  consisting of six basic (happiness, sadness, fear, disgust,
                  surprise, and anger) emotions and the neutral emotion, named
                  SEED-VII. This multimodal dataset includes
                  electroencephalography (EEG) and eye movement signals. The
                  seven emotions in SEED-VII are elicited by 80 different videos
