                  plague VAEs. We provide empirical studies on six datasets,
                  namely, static and binary MNIST, OMNIGLOT, Caltech 101
                  Silhouettes, Frey Faces and Histopathology patches, and show
                  that applying the hierarchical VampPrior delivers
