  abstract     = {This paper demonstrates an approach for learning highly
                  semantic image representations without relying on hand-crafted
                  data-augmentations. We introduce the Image-based
                  Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture (I-JEPA), a
                  non-generative approach for self-supervised learning from
