  date         = {2014-02-03},
  doi          = {10.3389/fnhum.2014.00020},
  abstract     = {Entropy is a dimensionless quantity that is used for measuring
                  uncertainty about the state of a system but it can also imply
                  physical qualities, where high entropy is synonymous with high
                  disorder. Entropy is applied here in the context of states of
                  consciousness and their associated neurodynamics, with a
