                  group). Participants in the second group received two
                  addiction counseling sessions on a monthly interval, but no
                  additional ketamine therapy sessions (single KPT group). At
                  one-year follow-up, survival analysis demonstrated a
                  significantly higher rate of abstinence in the multiple KPT
                  group. Thirteen out of 26 subjects (50\%) in the multiple KPT
