                  we resolve routing patterns at all levels. Interestingly,
                  local interventions within one sub-network may remotely
                  determine nonlocal network-wide communication. These results
                  help understanding and designing information routing patterns
                  across systems where collective dynamics co-occurs with a
                  communication function.},
