                  coupling in alpha-mu band (8-12 Hz) was estimated by a
                  three-step multilevel analysis procedure based on running
                  window circular correlation coefficient and post hoc power of
                  the findings was calculated using simulations. Our findings
                  indicate that hand-holding during pain administration
                  increases brain-to-brain coupling in a network that mainly
