  abstract     = {Testing with phase-randomised surrogate signals has been used
                  extensively to search for interesting nonlinear dynamical
                  structure in experimental time series. In this paper we argue
                  that, in the case of experimental time series with strong
                  periodic components, the method of phase-randomised surrogate
