  doi          = {10.1063/5.0024890},
  abstract     = {Machine learning has become a widely popular and successful
                  paradigm, especially in data-driven science and engineering. A
                  major application problem is data-driven forecasting of future
                  states from a complex dynamical system. Artificial neural
                  networks have evolved as a clear leader among many machine
