                  we design a hardware-aware parallel algorithm in recurrent
                  mode. We integrate these selective SSMs into a simplified
                  end-to-end neural network architecture without attention or
                  even MLP blocks (Mamba). Mamba enjoys fast inference
                  (5$\times$ higher throughput than Transformers) and linear
                  scaling in sequence length, and its performance improves on
