               cppEDM, has only been used for small datasets due to
               computational cost. With the growth of data collection
               capabilities, there is a great need to identify causal
               relationships in large datasets. We present mpEDM, a parallel
               distributed implementation of EDM optimized for modern
               GPU-centric supercomputers. We improve the original algorithm to
               reduce redundant computation and optimize the implementation to
               fully utilize hardware resources such as GPUs and SIMD units. As
