                  attention, and showed increased IFG activation during an
                  inhibitory fMRI task. This proof-of-concept study demonstrates
                  for the first time feasibility, safety, and shorter- and
                  longer-term efficacy of rtfMRI-NF of rIFG in adolescents with
                  ADHD. Hum Brain Mapp 38:3190-3209, 2017. © 2017 The Authors
