                  core neurons maintain content and enable perceptual constancy.
                  We further propose that conscious integration, segregation,
                  and continuity depend on the convergent nature of
                  corticothalamic projections enabling dimensionality reduction,
                  a thalamic reticular nucleus-mediated divisive
