                  method presumes that all relevant dimensions are sampled
                  through measurement. To address dynamical systems in which the
                  data may be incomplete or represent only partial observation
                  of a more complex system, we extend the DMD algorithm by
                  including a Mori-Zwanzig Decomposition to derive memory
