                  neuromodulation, much remains unknown about the network-level
                  impact of these focal perturbations. To study the system wide
                  impact of regional stimulation, we employ a data-driven
                  computational model of nonlinear brain dynamics to
                  systematically explore the effects of targeted stimulation.
