  abstract     = {Decision making often involves the accumulation of information
                  over time, but acquiring information typically comes at a
                  cost. Little is known about the cost incurred by animals and
                  humans for acquiring additional information from sensory
                  variables due, for instance, to attentional efforts. Through a
