                  results provide objective electrophysiological landmarks of
                  distinct unconscious brain states, and could be used to help
                  improve EEG-based monitoring for general anesthesia.},
  urldate      = {2025-06-16},
  keywords     = {Slow oscillation; anesthesia; cross-frequency coupling;
